{"ref":"BDB, סֹלְלָה","hw":"סֹלְלָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סֹלְלָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. mound</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ס׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.15\">2 S 20:15</a> + 7 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">סוֹלְלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:15\" href=\"/Daniel.11.15\">Dn 11:15</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">סֹלְלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.24\">Je 32:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.4\">33:4</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁפַךְ ס׳ עַל־הָעִיר</span> <em>cast up mound against the city</em>, besieging it, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:32\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.32\">2 K 19:32</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:33\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.33\">Is 37:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.6\">Je 6:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.2\">Ez 4:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.8\">26:8</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.15\">2 S 20:15</a> (error for <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span>); without <span dir=\"rtl\">על העיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.17\">Ez 17:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.27\">21:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:15\" href=\"/Daniel.11.15\">Dn 11:15</a>; without vb. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:24\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.24\">Je 32:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.4\">33:4</a>.","next":"BDB, סֻלָּם","prev":"BDB, סֶ֫לָה²"}